            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nen, wi gudi tiend ng’atu m’ukelo rwonglembe ma ber, m’urweyo pi kwiocwiny! Kwir agba peri. E Yuda tim lembang’ola peri; kum jadubo bikadhu kud i ii kendo ngo; ethumbre woko kot.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.15",
